{{ spec.info.title }} tools for Cursor. This plugin packages {{ spec.info.title }} SDK skills, the hosted {{ spec.info.title }} MCP server, and deployment commands.

## Installation

Install the plugin from the [Cursor Marketplace](https://cursor.com/marketplace/appwrite):

1. Open **Customize** in the Cursor sidebar.
2. Search for **{{ spec.info.title }}**.
3. Select **Install** and choose a project or user scope.

To try a local copy instead, clone this repository into `~/.cursor/plugins/local/{{ spec.info.title | caseLower }}` and run **Developer: Reload Window**. A marketplace install with the same plugin name takes precedence over the local copy.

## Skills

The plugin includes {{ spec.info.title }} skills for the following languages and tools:

{% for lang, label in languages %}
